This project depends on third-party open source packages. Their licenses are listed below.

| Package | License | Notes |
|---------|---------|-------|
| boto3 | Apache-2.0 | AWS SDK for Python |
| botocore | Apache-2.0 | AWS SDK core |
| psycopg2-binary | LGPL-3.0 | PostgreSQL adapter for Python |
| jmespath | MIT | JSON query language |
| python-dateutil | Apache-2.0 / BSD-3-Clause | Date utilities |
| s3transfer | Apache-2.0 | S3 multipart transfer |
| six | MIT | Python 2/3 compatibility |
| urllib3 | MIT | HTTP client |
| PGPerfStatsSnapper | MIT | PostgreSQL performance stats snapshots (aws-samples/aurora-and-database-migration-labs) |

No third-party source code, datasets, or ML models are bundled or redistributed here.
Python packages are downloaded at runtime (online mode) or pre-bundled as binary wheels (airgapped mode).
PGPerfStatsSnapper is cloned at runtime (online mode) or included as source in vendor/pgsnapper/ (airgapped mode).
